# SAME-REG: LLVM ERROR: OPEN B.ASSEMBLE parent register has a second real definition
# REAL-COPY: LLVM ERROR: cannot copy an OPEN B.ASSEMBLE parent source before LAST
# CROSS-HAND-COPY: LLVM ERROR: cannot copy an OPEN B.ASSEMBLE parent source before LAST
# LAST-SPOOF: LLVM ERROR: cannot copy an OPEN B.ASSEMBLE parent source before LAST
# BOUND: LLVM ERROR: B.ASSEMBLE parent relative distance exceeds the 16-entry Local tile window
